# Every interpreter entry (each compiled-to-interpreted bounce) walked the
# environment for the write-log state option and zeroed the quiescent-state
# ring even when the run is not an auto-quiescent scheduler run. Resolve the
# option once; clear the ring only for the runs that read it.
